  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BANGLADESH ELECTION SUPPORT PROGRAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (s) of the Project are to: 
1) Bolster the Bangladesh Election Commission&#x2019;s capacity to deliver elections 
with integrity for all people; 
2) Enhance the capacity of civil society organizations to deliver effective civic and 
voter education that fosters voter turnout and a lasting commitment to 
democratic culture and rights for all citizens; and 
3) Equip historically marginalized groups &#x2013; particularly women and people with 
disabilities &#x2013; with the skills to take on leadership roles and participate actively 
in the public proces</narrative>
  </description>
